<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>France 24 - International breaking news, top stories and headlines</title><subtitle type="html">Breaking news and world news from France 24 on Business, Sports, Culture. Video news. News from the US, Europe, Asia Pacific, Africa, Middle East, America</subtitle><id>https://www.france24.com/en/rss</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:55:11Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/rss" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Meet 'America': Trump’s AI chatbot changes answers after challenging his claims</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dd1e1d3d8011ee717b3f7ceaa7edeb75dd080adb575f41f1ce7fff0320b7db04</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:02Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T20:08:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/meet-america-trump-s-ai-chatbot-changes-answers-after-challenging-his-claims-1--7d4ab69afaa6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/meet-america-trump-s-ai-chatbot-changes-answers-after-challenging-his-claims-1" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump has launched “America”, an AI chatbot designed as a digital portal for US government information. But its responses appear to be changing. The chatbot initially challenged several of Trump’s claims, including on the 2020 election and inflation, providing evidence and links. More recently, it has refused to answer some of the same questions. Other responses still contradict Trump, while some echo his views. Vedika Bahl tests the chatbot, and its varying answers in Truth or Fake.</summary><category term="Truth or Fake" /></entry><entry><title>'Hard to see Man City getting anything other than the book thrown at them', expert says</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a6d2e075eec65522ab5fc21bfb699179b627a31f836577aac09980f64fa5b025</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:05Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T19:56:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/hard-to-see-man-city-getting-anything-other-than-the-book-thrown-at-them-expert-says--eec4ac67ec8e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/hard-to-see-man-city-getting-anything-other-than-the-book-thrown-at-them-expert-says" /><summary type="html">Manchester City enjoyed a meteoric rise from mid-table mediocrity to Premier League domination, but their golden era could be forever tarnished after they were found guilty of scores of financial rule breaches. FRANCE 24's Mark Owen speaks with James Reade, Professor of Economics at the University of Reading. He says that it's unlikely that the club will see any leniency from football authorities: "it's hard to see it getting anything other than the book thrown at them".</summary></entry><entry><title>Ronaldo leaves Portugal training camp after coach drops him from upcoming match</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:81f7bc062ec55f20314639eb3d06e9212516b5314f13468fdc00edbb30246071</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:08Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T19:14:33Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/sport/20260930-ronaldo-leaves-portugal-training-camp-after-coach-drops-him-from-upcoming-match--008afe162416.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/sport/20260930-ronaldo-leaves-portugal-training-camp-after-coach-drops-him-from-upcoming-match" /><summary type="html">Portugal captain and striker Cristiano Ronaldo said Wednesday he had walked out on the national team's training camp in Copenhagen after coach Jorge Jesus announced the 41-year-old player would be dropped from the team's next match against Denmark.</summary><category term="Sport" /></entry><entry><title>Clashes between French teens, police as school blockades intensify</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9b93b98c74474b383beb42e188061ae40fe4cbf09aea2ae2c77a89918c0eb031</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:11Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T19:07:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/clashes-between-french-teens-police-as-school-blockades-intensify--c2939a8fc8e9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/clashes-between-french-teens-police-as-school-blockades-intensify" /><summary type="html">French teenagers on Tuesday set fire to rubbish bins and threw projectiles at police who responded with batons and tear gas, with hundreds detained across the country over the blockades and protests demanding better conditions at schools. Since last week, students have staged protests outside hundreds of schools over grievances including timetables, class sizes and a shortage of teachers as well as overheated classrooms during this year's heatwaves. FRANCE 24's Rachel Griffiths reports.</summary></entry><entry><title>Ethiopia back to civil war? Horn of Africa fears spillover effect of renewed fighting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4cdb6bd9d14b015841cfb4aed104abe1789c8735fea33910384b532f8784a5c7</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:14Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T19:04:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/the-debate/20260930-ethiopia-back-to-civil-war-horn-of-africa-fears-spillover-effect-of-renewed-fighting--2f65ee3843c5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/the-debate/20260930-ethiopia-back-to-civil-war-horn-of-africa-fears-spillover-effect-of-renewed-fighting" /><summary type="html">After contagion in the Arabian Peninsula, should the entire Horn of Africa fear a domino effect? Just as Donald Trump’s decision to invade Iran drew the Saudis back to Yemen: did threats over the Strait of Bab el-Mandeb light the fuse in Ethiopia, where last week, unresolved issues between the government and its Tigray region erupted? Could a potential return to civil war draw in regional rivals?</summary><category term="The Debate" /></entry><entry><title>British PM alleges there are 'strong indications' Iran was involved in Fairford airbase incident</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a875e8e9f914a23fe59ef72588e7ad0d678811f0ac73c1887db19cbc0caf4da2</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:17Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T19:01:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260930-british-pm-alleges-there-are-strong-indications-iran-was-involved-in-fairford-airbase-incid--08fbaf5d3af6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260930-british-pm-alleges-there-are-strong-indications-iran-was-involved-in-fairford-airbase-incident" /><summary type="html">UK Prime Minister Andy Burnham on Wednesday insisted that there were "strong indications" that Tehran was involved in a security incident on Sunday near an airbase in England that the US military uses in its war against Iran. The British government has still not explained the nature of the incident – in which five British men were arrested only to be later released on bail – and no explosives were found at the scene.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>UK-France 'one in, one out' migrant exchange deal is scrapped</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e4820d25dae4948e8d0b6bfa7ddbb4d2b053acf06d59fc6b613c90f669f278b3</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T17:12:12Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260930-uk-france-one-in-one-out-migrant-exchange-deal-is-scrapped--b0a81c404ab0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260930-uk-france-one-in-one-out-migrant-exchange-deal-is-scrapped" /><summary type="html">A British-French agreement aimed at reducing the number of people trying to cross the English Channel in small boats has been scrapped, London said Wednesday. The pilot programme was intended to break the business model of "people smugglers" by exchanging undocumented migrants who had made the crossing for people who legally applied for asylum.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>France to unveil 2027 budget as debt hits record high</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f7172abc70d552c7d67ebf9b7980f1d9609cc84e6d5caf4dde62df5a2348ea99</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:23Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T16:58:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-france-to-unveil-2027-budget-as-debt-hits-record-high--f66186eaa935.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-france-to-unveil-2027-budget-as-debt-hits-record-high" /><summary type="html">As the French government prepares to unveil its latest budget, the country's debt is at a record high and growing every day. France's public debt currently stands at nearly 3.6 trillion euros, nearly 60 billion of that added in the last three months alone.</summary></entry><entry><title>Israel PM says pilot of rerouted flight tried to crash plane</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fe105611e7100b088b099584a45aa5f713812903c4455be9b951742774cefc6b</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:27Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T16:57:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-israel-pm-says-pilot-of-rerouted-flight-tried-to-crash-plane--5cabcaf4d8c8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-israel-pm-says-pilot-of-rerouted-flight-tried-to-crash-plane" /><summary type="html">Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu said Wednesday that the pilot of a Tel Aviv-bound flydubai flight had tried to crash the plane and kill its passengers, after the aircraft was forced to make an emergency landing in Saudi Arabia. Passengers gave a similar account of the incident on board, describing a fight for control after the plane suddenly plummeted, losing around 17,000 feet of altitude in the span of a minute, according to the Flightradar24 website.</summary></entry><entry><title>New York Gov pushes for probe into Cornell's handling of gang rape allegation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fc0e183651f3bea31ac686073923e24ccae93dce617bf344744f6cd2d8dbb687</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T16:55:36Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-new-york-gov-pushes-for-probe-into-cornell-s-handling-of-gang-rape-allegation--be0ab32fac39.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-new-york-gov-pushes-for-probe-into-cornell-s-handling-of-gang-rape-allegation" /><summary type="html">New York Gov. Kathy Hochul on Tuesday called for an investigation into Cornell University's response to a 2024 gang rape allegation in which a woman says she was sexually assaulted by seven students after being plied with alcohol and drugs. It comes as prosecutors reopen an investigation into the alleged rape following claims the elite college failed to properly punish the men involved.</summary></entry><entry><title>Climate change reshaping the polar oceans, says report</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:31c86b9004f89491655b92ce663dbc9a40e01e54a2fced1c3b1fe0c1bb5dd405</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:32Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T16:53:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-climate-change-reshaping-the-polar-oceans-says-report--cea26863ccb0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-climate-change-reshaping-the-polar-oceans-says-report" /><summary type="html">Climate change is increasingly reshaping the polar oceans, with Arctic waters warming rapidly, sea ice shrinking and wildlife losing habitat at both ends of the planet, an annual report said Wednesday. The Copernicus Ocean State Report depicts profound changes across the world's seas, from record-breaking heatwaves in the Mediterranean and Black seas to shifts in marine ecosystems and increasingly acidic waters.</summary></entry><entry><title>Syria: An exclusive look at the integration of Uyghur fighters in armed forces</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:88f0d98dad42e3b6f34a0cb58ac2912909324ba54bbeeae045657eee031c0a4d</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T16:45:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-syria-an-exclusive-look-at-the-integration-of-uyghur-fighters-in-armed-forces--7e259938e61f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-syria-an-exclusive-look-at-the-integration-of-uyghur-fighters-in-armed-forces" /><summary type="html">Several factions of foreign fighters are credited with helping topple Syria's Bashar al-Assad nearly two years ago - among them, the Uyghurs, a predominantly Muslim, Turkic ethnic minority spread across Central Asia - notably in China's Xinjiang region. They eventually became amongst the largest contingents of foreign fighters in Syria, though those who have stayed and built lives there are notoriously secretive. However, France 24's Wassim Nasr was recently in Syria and had exclusive access to Uyghur fighters there.</summary></entry><entry><title>‘Attempted terror attack’: What happened on board the rerouted Flydubai flight?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:402f23c65e8c02b3005ddc3bc8143594f893ba11ea42b19677b957051997c8ad</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:38Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T16:04:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-attempted-terror-attack-what-happened-on-board-the-rerouted-flydubai-flight--427fdbaf19b7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-attempted-terror-attack-what-happened-on-board-the-rerouted-flydubai-flight" /><summary type="html">The co-pilot of a flight from Dubai to Tel Aviv ​tried ‌to crash the plane after stabbing the pilot, but passengers then ⁠held him down while other pilots landed the plane safely in Saudi Arabia, Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu said ‌on Wednesday.</summary></entry><entry><title>Appeals court halts execution of Tennessee woman less than two hours before lethal injection</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:53e98848c2820d48bcc7507960ba10b6004d9339455d423de8a1f46931694aca</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T16:03:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20260930-appeals-court-halts-execution-of-tennessee-woman-less-than-two-hours-before-lethal-injectio--883b9a62beca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20260930-appeals-court-halts-execution-of-tennessee-woman-less-than-two-hours-before-lethal-injection" /><summary type="html">A US appeals court ordered a "short stay of execution" for death row inmate Christa Pike, less than two hours before she was scheduled to be the first woman put to death in the state in more than two centuries. The court halted the execution to give it time to consider Pike's claims that her history of severe sexual abuse had not been taken into consideration during sentencing.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Russia ramps up disinformation attacks on French media ahead of 2027 Presidential race</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:96b614a84fb40f0adb4a5202ba4112322059919a7c4b581165fa799137b4ef57</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T15:29:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/france/20260930-russia-ramps-up-disinformation-attacks-on-french-media-ahead-of-2027-presidential-race--e64ed2b11479.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france/20260930-russia-ramps-up-disinformation-attacks-on-french-media-ahead-of-2027-presidential-race" /><summary type="html">Pro-Russian influence operations have caused a surge of 850% in fake news stories mimicking real media brands, according to a report published this week by disinformation specialist, NewsGuard. Out of the 15 most imitated news outlets, eight are French – including FRANCE 24.</summary><category term="France" /></entry><entry><title>Prosecutor reopens probe into Cornell gang rape allegations</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:30305c0778b03e99f1b9cae9fa1baeaa131d853a03c4509b82961e2ef28908f1</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:48Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T15:06:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-prosecutor-reopens-probe-into-cornell-gang-rape-allegations--ef5ea899c7a4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-prosecutor-reopens-probe-into-cornell-gang-rape-allegations" /><summary type="html">A New York prosecutor has reopened an investigation into gang rape allegations at a Cornell University fraternity in response to a lawsuit filed by a woman who says she was sexually assaulted in 2024 by seven students after being plied with alcohol and drugs. Tompkins County District Attorney Matthew Van Houten said Monday that his office will present evidence to a grand jury as he faces questions from the public about why there were no criminal prosecutions in the case. France 24's Annette Young, host of The 51 %, has more.</summary></entry><entry><title>Macron says UK’s return to EU would be ‘excellent news’</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d8355fa0f23e8ad0ff8a1f3806ec6f53b9a9b42c339a0fb8654397c18bdc82ff</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:50Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T15:01:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-replay-france-s-macron-calls-for-stronger-europe-on-spain-trip--03f6f8b2a7b4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-replay-france-s-macron-calls-for-stronger-europe-on-spain-trip" /><summary type="html">Speaking alongside Spanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez on Wednesday, French President Emmanuel Macron said that it would be "a good decision" if the UK decided to rejoin the European Union. The two leaders met at the Moncloa Palace in Madrid on the second day of Macron's two-day state visit to Spain.</summary></entry><entry><title>Tom Cruise's 'Digger' divides critics as Zurich Film Festival stars steal the spotlight</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ed79dfc2c541f1844fb6b02abd66461d7202a670c293aa4856047214b2b8fb76</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T14:47:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/arts24/20260930-tom-cruise-s-digger-divides-critics-as-zurich-film-festival-stars-steal-the-spotlight--15b3066c19c8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/arts24/20260930-tom-cruise-s-digger-divides-critics-as-zurich-film-festival-stars-steal-the-spotlight" /><summary type="html">This week on arts24's film show, an unrecognisable Tom Cruise takes a career gamble in "Digger", Alejandro González Iñárritu’s new satire, in which he plays an oil billionaire whose company initiates a world-ending ecological disaster. Critics are divided, but is an Oscar nomination possible? Also in cinemas this week, Anne Hathaway and Dakota Johnson star in the latest Colleen Hoover adaptation, "Verity".</summary><category term="arts24" /></entry><entry><title>What if art could help you live longer?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c2f9d53ce4a9613a75020645ce9dad77553ee5a0225307fecf528b4675a38704</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T14:02:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/entre-nous/20260930-what-if-art-could-help-you-live-longer--07d6782f156e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/entre-nous/20260930-what-if-art-could-help-you-live-longer" /><summary type="html">In this episode of Entre Nous, Delano D'Souza speaks to Daisy Fancourt, professor at University College London and a leading researcher on how the arts affects our brains and bodies. In her book "Art Cure" she draws on scientific evidence to show how the arts can transform our health and what her research suggests we should be doing to optimise the benefits.</summary><category term="Entre Nous" /></entry><entry><title>Ex-TV anchor crowned as king in Uganda after succession fight</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:92c1c747222c59c46e44d3355ad41dd421e53e51924abef2c2ec69693365425a</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:54:59Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T13:10:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-ex-tv-anchor-crowned-as-king-in-uganda-after-succession-fight--f23b398b9b1b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-ex-tv-anchor-crowned-as-king-in-uganda-after-succession-fight" /><summary type="html">A former television news anchor was crowned king of Uganda's Tooro Kingdom on Tuesday, becoming the 13th monarch of the Batooro people in a ritual-laden coronation that ended a succession dispute. Edward Rukidi Kijanangoma succeeded King Oyo Nyimba Kabamba Iguru Rukidi IV, whose death ​last month from ‌cancer at age 34 triggered a feud, with his mother saying a previously undisclosed son was entitled to ⁠the throne.</summary></entry><entry><title>Macron says UK’s return to EU would be ‘excellent news’</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2d99f20edd492c63bc4b07b15ef6c5c5f5ad4e74867882eb2f885d3ecb22b76d</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:55:02Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T11:49:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260930-live-macron-sanchez-hold-joint-press-conference-during-french-president-s-spain-visit--5a73e2256a58.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260930-live-macron-sanchez-hold-joint-press-conference-during-french-president-s-spain-visit" /><summary type="html">Speaking alongside Spanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez on Wednesday, French President Emmanuel Macron said that it would be "a good decision" if the UK decided to rejoin the European Union. The two leaders met at the Moncloa Palace in Madrid on the second day of Macron's two-day state visit to Spain.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Forced landing of Israel-bound flight: What we know so far</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:255a811745fe90a12981b61451e12408519551b05d0f21df25ef1706ba757917</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:55:05Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T11:29:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-forced-landing-of-israel-bound-flight-what-we-know-so-far--3c5a05770c4a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-forced-landing-of-israel-bound-flight-what-we-know-so-far" /><summary type="html">The Israeli government believes an incident on a flight from the United Arab Emirates to Israel, which diverted to Saudi Arabia after transmitting emergency signals on Wednesday, may have been an attempted "terror attack" by one of the pilots. France 24’s Shirli Sitbon takes a look at what we know about the incident so far, with many of the details still emerging.</summary></entry><entry><title>Mixed reactions in Iraq on final day of US-led coalition withdrawal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:99e749348e2b908cf9eefef2242ef02136029dbe7109e354f559ba55949f72fb</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:55:08Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T11:27:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-mixed-reactions-in-iraq-on-final-day-of-us-led-coalition-withdrawal--29152cc8659b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-mixed-reactions-in-iraq-on-final-day-of-us-led-coalition-withdrawal" /><summary type="html">The US military announced on Wednesday that it has completed the withdrawal of all American troops from Iraq, ending a 12-year mission to fight the Islamic State group. The last US troops left an air base in northern Iraq under a deal between Baghdad and Washington.</summary></entry><entry><title>Why is the US withdrawing its troops from Iraq?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:07109f72cff0b0fefb51d397d3314539b5e6c13c7020d6a0b08ed868b31123de</id><updated>2026-09-30T20:55:11Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T11:18:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-why-is-the-us-withdrawing-its-troops-from-iraq--2256efabf28f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-why-is-the-us-withdrawing-its-troops-from-iraq" /><summary type="html">A US-led coalition deployed in Iraq more than a decade ago to fight jihadists concluded its mission on Wednesday, a move celebrated by the country's leaders, but which some fear will embolden pro-Iran armed factions. France 24's Angela Diffley takes a look at the security challenges facing the country and why the US has chosen this moment to take its troops out.</summary></entry></feed>
